# acidrain - phrygian 303 line, filter wide open
bpm 134
swing 20
humanize kick 4
humanize hat 4
humanize oh 4
humanize clap 4
humanize snare 4
humanize perc 4
humanize bass 4
humanize stab 4
kick x...x...x...x...
hat x..x..x.x..x..x.
clap ....x.......x...
bass a#1! a1! c2 c3 a#2! a1 f1 . g1 f1 . g1 a1 a#1 . g1!
filter bass lp 340 res 0.94
sidechain bass 0.7
